{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>Slime Scramble</i>, a relaxing, cartoony adventure where you play as a little slime with big dreams! Your mission? Gobble up as many green slimes as you can to grow stronger while dodging threats that keep you on your toes. Watch out for the red slimes \u2013 they're bigger and not so friendly! But that's not all; airborne Flying Slimes soar above with even more power, while the Poison Jumper Slime, the ultimate threat, jumps into the fray, keeping you alert. How big can you grow before things get too sticky? Find out in this dark, thrilling slime scramble!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3022510?t=1757138704","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022510/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757138704","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022510/82d01813b3eebc839d0cc45894da1ec45dacd9a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757138704","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022510/82d01813b3eebc839d0cc45894da1ec45dacd9a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757138704","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>Slime Scramble</i>, a relaxing, cartoony adventure where you play as a little slime with big dreams! Your mission? Gobble up as many green slimes as you can to grow stronger while dodging threats that keep you on your toes. Watch out for the red slimes \u2013 they're bigger and not so friendly! But that's not all; airborne Flying Slimes soar above with even more power, while the Poison Jumper Slime, the ultimate threat, jumps into the fray, keeping you alert. How big can you grow before things get too sticky? Find out in this dark, thrilling slime